    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λᾰγώ-πους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rough-footed like a hare</i>:
			hence, as Subst., </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>ptarmigan</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				10.133
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαγώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a downy plant,
				<i>hare's foot trefoil, Trifolium arvense</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.56
			</span></i>. (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πουν</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> cc., but -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πους</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				15.1.11
			</span></i>.)</div>
